2026-11-07T11:51:14.2189663Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2190207Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2190676Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2191144Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2191529Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2191862Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2192370Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2192787Z    /root
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2200412Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2201207Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2210938Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2211717Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2212045Z 
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2212375Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-07T11:51:14.2212855Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
